/* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   IfaLens Playground — styles
   IfaView · ToE View · STEAMSEX Grid · 0+8D SIDECHRX Matrix
   CENProject · IFA Internet
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

:root {
  --bg:    #06080e;
  --bg2:   #0a0f1a;
  --bg3:   #0d1322;
  --bg4:   #111827;
  --text:  #e8ecf2;
  --muted: #8892a4;
  --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
  --lens:  #8b5cf6;
  --view:  #00d9b8;
  --steam: #4aa3ff;
  font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
}

html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); overflow-x: hidden; }
a    { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }
button { cursor: pointer; border: none; background: none; font: inherit; color: inherit; }

/* ── Playground Header ──────────────────────────────────────── */
.pg-header {
  position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 200;
  padding: 14px 32px;
  transition: background .3s, border-color .3s, backdrop-filter .3s;
  border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
}
.pg-header--scrolled {
  background: rgba(6, 8, 14, .92);
  backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
  border-bottom-color: var(--border);
}
.pg-header__inner {
  max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;
}
.pg-header__brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-width: 0; }
.pg-header__back {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
  font-size: .8rem; color: var(--muted); transition: color .2s;
}
.pg-header__back:hover { color: var(--lens); }
.pg-header__sep { color: var(--border); font-size: 1rem; }
.pg-header__title { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; }
.pg-header__ifa { color: var(--lens); }
.pg-header__badge {
  font-size: .6rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  color: var(--view); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 217, 184, .35);
  padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 10px;
}
.pg-header__nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; }
.pg-header__link { font-size: .82rem; color: var(--muted); transition: color .2s; }
.pg-header__link:hover { color: var(--text); }
.pg-header__cta {
  background: var(--lens); color: #fff;
  padding: 7px 16px; border-radius: 6px;
  font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 600;
  transition: opacity .2s, transform .15s;
}
.pg-header__cta:hover { opacity: .85; transform: translateY(-1px); }

/* ── Tab Bar ────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.pg-tabs {
  position: sticky; top: 52px; z-index: 100;
  background: rgba(6, 8, 14, .95);
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.pg-tabs__inner {
  max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px;
  display: flex; gap: 4px; overflow-x: auto; scrollbar-width: none;
}
.pg-tabs__inner::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
.pg-tab {
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start;
  padding: 12px 20px; white-space: nowrap;
  border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
  transition: border-color .2s, background .2s;
}
.pg-tab:hover:not(:disabled) { background: rgba(139, 92, 246, .05); }
.pg-tab--active { border-bottom-color: var(--lens); background: rgba(139, 92, 246, .06); }
.pg-tab--soon   { opacity: .4; cursor: default; }
.pg-tab__label  { font-size: .88rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); }
.pg-tab__sub    { font-size: .68rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 1px; }

/* ── Main content ───────────────────────────────────────────── */
.pg-main { padding-top: 100px; min-height: 100vh; }

/* ── Shared badge ───────────────────────────────────────────── */
.pg-badge {
  display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 16px;
  font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--lens); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, .35);
  padding: 4px 14px; border-radius: 20px;
}

/* ── IfaView Tab ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.ifaview-tab { max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 32px 80px; }
.ifaview-tab__hd { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 48px; }
.ifaview-tab__title {
  font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -1px; margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.ifaview-tab__title-sub {
  display: block; font-size: clamp(.85rem, 1.5vw, 1rem);
  font-weight: 400; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: .5px; margin-top: 8px;
}
.ifaview-tab__lead {
  font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--muted);
  max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;
}
.ifaview-tab__divider {
  border: none; max-width: 720px; margin: 0.75rem auto;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
}
.accent-lens  { color: var(--lens); }
.accent-steam { color: var(--steam); }

/* ── System Toggle ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
.system-toggle {
  display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center;
  margin-bottom: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.sys-btn {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px;
  padding: 14px 24px; border-radius: 10px;
  border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
  background: var(--bg2); transition: all .2s; min-width: 220px;
}
.sys-btn:hover { border-color: rgba(139,92,246,.4); background: rgba(139,92,246,.06); }
.sys-btn--active {
  border-color: var(--lens); background: rgba(139,92,246,.1);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(139,92,246,.2);
}
.sys-btn__num { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--lens); opacity: .5; line-height: 1; flex-shrink: 0; }
.sys-btn--active .sys-btn__num { opacity: 1; }
.sys-btn__label { font-size: .92rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); display: block; }
.sys-btn__sub   { font-size: .72rem; color: var(--muted); display: block; margin-top: 2px; }

/* ── System description ─────────────────────────────────────── */
.sys-desc {
  text-align: center; font-size: .88rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--muted);
  max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto 32px;
  padding: 14px 20px; border-radius: 10px;
  background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.sys-desc strong { color: var(--text); }
.sys-desc em     { color: var(--view); font-style: normal; }
.inline-ogbe {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: rgba(245,197,24,.15); border: 1px solid rgba(245,197,24,.4);
  color: #f5c518; font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 900; vertical-align: middle;
}

/* ── Legend shared ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
.legend-label {
  font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--muted); flex-shrink: 0; margin-right: 4px;
}

/* ── STEAMSEX Legend ────────────────────────────────────────── */
.steamsex-legend {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
  flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center;
  margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px 16px;
  background: rgba(74,163,255,.04);
  border: 1px solid rgba(74,163,255,.12); border-radius: 10px;
}
.steam-chip {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;
  padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 20px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09);
  transition: border-color .18s, background .18s;
}
.steam-chip:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.07); border-color: var(--cc); }
.steam-chip__icon { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--cc); }
.steam-chip__code { font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--cc); font-family: monospace; }
.steam-chip__name { font-size: .66rem; color: var(--muted); }

/* ── SIDECHRX Legend ────────────────────────────────────────── */
.sidechrx-legend {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
  flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center;
  margin-bottom: 28px; padding: 12px 16px;
  background: rgba(139,92,246,.04);
  border: 1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.12); border-radius: 10px;
}
.sidechrx-chip {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
  padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 20px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09);
  transition: border-color .18s, background .18s;
}
.sidechrx-chip:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.07); border-color: var(--cc); }
.sidechrx-chip__id   { font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--cc); font-family: monospace; }
.sidechrx-chip__name { font-size: .66rem; color: var(--muted); }

/* ── PToE Table wrapper ─────────────────────────────────────── */
.ptoe-wrap   { position: relative; margin-bottom: 24px; }
.ptoe-scroll {
  overflow-x: auto; border-radius: 12px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg2);
}
.ptoe-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar { height: 5px; }
.ptoe-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--bg); }
.ptoe-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(139,92,246,.3); border-radius: 10px; }

/* ── PToE Table layout ──────────────────────────────────────── */
.ptoe-table { min-width: 920px; padding: 8px; }
.ptoe-col-headers {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 52px repeat(8, minmax(108px, 1fr));
  gap: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.ptoe-corner {
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end;
  padding-bottom: 10px; gap: 2px;
}
.ptoe-corner-vi { font-size: .65rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--lens); letter-spacing: 1px; }
.ptoe-corner-hi { font-size: .65rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--steam); letter-spacing: 1px; }

.ptoe-col-hd {
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;
  padding: 10px 6px; border-radius: 8px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.03);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
  border-top: 2.5px solid var(--col-c);
  transition: background .2s;
}
.ptoe-col-hd:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); }
.ptoe-col-hd__icon { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--col-c); margin-bottom: 3px; }
.ptoe-col-hd__code {
  font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--col-c);
  font-family: monospace; letter-spacing: 1px;
}
.ptoe-col-hd__name {
  font-size: .65rem; color: var(--text); text-align: center;
  font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; margin-top: 3px;
}

/* ── PToE Data Row ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
.ptoe-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 52px repeat(8, minmax(108px, 1fr));
  gap: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.ptoe-row:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.ptoe-row-hd {
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  gap: 3px; padding: 4px;
}
.ptoe-row-hd__r  { font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--muted); }
.ptoe-row-hd__vi { font-size: .55rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.2); letter-spacing: .5px; }

/* ── PToE Cell ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.ptoe-cell {
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center;
  min-height: 72px; padding: 8px 10px;
  border-radius: 7px; text-align: left;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.03);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
  border-left: 2.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  transition: background .18s, border-color .18s, transform .15s, box-shadow .18s;
  position: relative; overflow: hidden; gap: 3px;
}
.ptoe-cell::before {
  content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
  background: var(--col-c); opacity: 0; transition: opacity .18s;
}
.ptoe-cell:hover::before { opacity: .06; }
.ptoe-cell:hover {
  border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.15);
  border-left-color: var(--col-c);
  transform: translateY(-1px);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.3), 0 0 0 1px color-mix(in srgb, var(--col-c) 30%, transparent) inset;
}
.ptoe-cell:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--lens); outline-offset: 2px; }

/* Ifa expression row in cells (System 2) */
.ptoe-cell__ifa-expr {
  font-size: .6rem; font-weight: 800; color: #f5c518;
  display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 1px; opacity: .9; position: relative; z-index: 1;
}
.ptoe-ogbe {
  font-size: .65em; vertical-align: sub;
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: rgba(245,197,24,.2); border: 1px solid rgba(245,197,24,.45);
  color: #f5c518; font-style: normal; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1;
  margin: 0 1px;
}
.ptoe-cell__name {
  font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text);
  line-height: 1.3; position: relative; z-index: 1;
}
.ptoe-cell__alias {
  font-size: .6rem; color: var(--col-c); font-weight: 700;
  opacity: .85; position: relative; z-index: 1;
}
.ptoe-cell__hint {
  font-size: .6rem; color: var(--col-c); opacity: 0;
  transition: opacity .18s; position: relative; z-index: 1; font-weight: 700;
}
.ptoe-cell:hover .ptoe-cell__hint { opacity: .75; }

.ptoe-cell--others {
  opacity: .28; pointer-events: none;
  background: transparent; border-style: dashed;
}
.ptoe-cell--others .ptoe-cell__name { font-size: .7rem; color: var(--muted); }

/* ── Axes annotations ───────────────────────────────────────── */
.ptoe-axes {
  display: flex; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 12px 0 20px;
}
.ptoe-axis {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  font-size: .78rem; color: var(--muted);
}
.ptoe-axis strong { color: var(--text); }
.ptoe-axis--hi span { color: var(--steam); }
.ptoe-axis--vi span { color: var(--lens); }

/* ── Info box ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.ptoe-info {
  display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start;
  background: rgba(139,92,246,.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.18);
  border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px 22px; margin-bottom: 0;
}
.ptoe-info__icon { font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--lens); flex-shrink: 0; }
.ptoe-info__text { font-size: .84rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--muted); }
.ptoe-info__text strong { color: var(--text); }

/* ── Modal Overlay ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
.modal-overlay {
  position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 1000;
  background: rgba(3, 5, 10, .85);
  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  padding: 20px;
  animation: overlay-in .2s ease;
}
@keyframes overlay-in { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }

/* ── Modal Panel ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.modal {
  position: relative;
  background: var(--bg3);
  border: 1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.28);
  border-radius: 18px;
  width: 100%; max-width: 1020px;
  max-height: 92vh; overflow-y: auto;
  padding: 36px;
  box-shadow: 0 32px 100px rgba(0,0,0,.7), 0 0 0 1px rgba(139,92,246,.12);
  animation: modal-in .24s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);
  scrollbar-width: thin;
  scrollbar-color: rgba(139,92,246,.3) transparent;
}
.modal::-webkit-scrollbar       { width: 5px; }
.modal::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(139,92,246,.3); border-radius: 10px; }
@keyframes modal-in {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(.95) translateY(12px); }
  to   { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1) translateY(0); }
}

.modal__close {
  position: absolute; top: 16px; right: 16px;
  width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 50%;
  font-size: .85rem; color: var(--muted);
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); border: 1px solid var(--border);
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  transition: background .15s, color .15s; z-index: 10;
}
.modal__close:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.12); color: var(--text); }

/* ── Modal Header ───────────────────────────────────────────── */
.modal__hd { margin-bottom: 28px; }

.modal__steam-chip {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
  font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.2px; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--steam-c); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--steam-c) 50%, transparent);
  padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px;
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--steam-c) 10%, transparent);
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.modal__steam-icon { font-size: 1rem; }
.modal__steam-code { font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 900; font-family: monospace; }
.modal__steam-name { }

.modal__title {
  font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
  font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -.5px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  color: var(--title-c, var(--text));
}
.modal__ogbe {
  font-size: .5em; vertical-align: sub;
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  width: 1.4em; height: 1.4em; border-radius: 50%;
  background: rgba(245,197,24,.18); border: 1px solid rgba(245,197,24,.4);
  color: #f5c518; font-style: normal; font-weight: 900;
  margin: 0 2px;
}

.modal__ifa-expr {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap;
  font-size: .82rem; margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.modal__ifa-label { color: var(--muted); font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; }
.modal__ifa-val   { font-weight: 700; }
.modal__alias     { opacity: .7; font-size: .75rem; }

/* Node row: diagram + info side by side */
.modal__node-row {
  display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 28px;
  padding: 20px; border-radius: 14px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.025);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);
  margin-bottom: 28px; flex-wrap: wrap;
}

/* Node SVG diagram */
.node-diagram {
  flex-shrink: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 20px rgba(139,92,246,.15));
}

/* Node info panel */
.modal__node-info { flex: 1; min-width: 220px; }
.modal__matrix-badge {
  display: inline-block;
  font-size: .65rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--lens); border: 1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.4);
  padding: 3px 12px; border-radius: 12px;
  background: rgba(139,92,246,.1); margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.modal__matrix-head {
  font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.modal__matrix-body {
  font-size: .82rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.modal__matrix-body strong { color: var(--text); }

/* Mini SIDECHRX chips inside modal */
.modal__sidechrx-mini {
  display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 5px;
}
.modal__sdim-chip {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;
  padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 12px;
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--d-c) 8%, transparent);
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--d-c) 30%, transparent);
}
.modal__sdim-id   { font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--d-c); font-family: monospace; }
.modal__sdim-name { font-size: .62rem; color: var(--muted); }

/* ── 8D Dimension Cards Grid ────────────────────────────────── */
.modal__dim-grid {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 24px;
}
.modal__dim {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.03);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--dim-c);
  border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 16px;
  transition: background .18s, box-shadow .18s;
  position: relative; overflow: hidden;
}
.modal__dim::after {
  content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 2px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--dim-c), transparent);
  opacity: 0; transition: opacity .2s;
}
.modal__dim:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.05); box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.2); }
.modal__dim:hover::after { opacity: .5; }

.modal__dim-hd {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.modal__dim-id-wrap {
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 8px;
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--dim-c) 14%, transparent);
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--dim-c) 35%, transparent);
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.modal__dim-icon { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--dim-c); }
.modal__dim-id   { font-size: .95rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--dim-c); font-family: monospace; }
.modal__dim-names { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.modal__dim-name { font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); }
.modal__dim-desc { font-size: .78rem; line-height: 1.68; color: var(--muted); overflow-wrap: break-word; }
.modal__dim-bar  { height: 2px; margin-top: 10px; border-radius: 2px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--dim-c) 35%, transparent); }

/* ── Modal Footer ───────────────────────────────────────────── */
.modal__ft {
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px;
}
.modal__ft-meta { font-size: .72rem; color: var(--muted); }
.modal__close-btn {
  padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 8px;
  background: rgba(139,92,246,.12); border: 1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.3);
  color: var(--lens); font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 600;
  transition: background .15s;
}
.modal__close-btn:hover { background: rgba(139,92,246,.22); }

/* ── Playground Footer ──────────────────────────────────────── */
.pg-footer {
  background: var(--bg2); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 28px 32px;
}
.pg-footer__inner {
  max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 8px; text-align: center;
}
.pg-footer__brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: .88rem; }
.pg-footer__link  { color: var(--lens); transition: opacity .2s; }
.pg-footer__link:hover { opacity: .75; }
.pg-footer__note  { font-size: .72rem; color: var(--muted); opacity: .7; }

/* ── Responsive ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
@media (max-width: 1050px) {
  .modal__node-row { gap: 18px; }
  .node-diagram svg { width: 220px; height: 220px; }
}
@media (max-width: 860px) {
  .modal__dim-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .modal__node-row { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
  .node-diagram svg { width: 240px; height: 240px; }
}
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .pg-header    { padding: 12px 20px; }
  .pg-header__nav { display: none; }
  .pg-tabs__inner { padding: 0 20px; }
  .ifaview-tab  { padding: 32px 20px 60px; }
  .ptoe-table   { min-width: 720px; }
  .modal        { padding: 24px 18px; max-width: 100%; }
  .modal__title { font-size: 1.5rem; }
  .steamsex-legend, .sidechrx-legend { padding: 10px 12px; }
}
/* ── IfaCircle Matrix (System 3) ────────────────────────────── */
.ifacm {
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;
  gap: 1rem; margin: 0 auto 2rem; max-width: 760px;
}
.ifacm__wrap {
  width: 100%; max-width: 700px;
  background: #06080e;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden;
}
.ifacm__svg { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
.ifacm__legend {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap;
  width: 100%; max-width: 700px;
  padding: 0.55rem 1rem;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.09);
  border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.82rem;
}
.ifacm__legend-icon { font-size: 1rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
.ifacm__legend-name { color: var(--lc, var(--lens)); font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; }
.ifacm__legend-hint { color: rgba(200,210,230,0.6); }
.ifacm__back {
  margin-left: auto; flex-shrink: 0;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  color: rgba(200,210,230,0.8);
  border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem;
  font-size: 0.75rem; cursor: pointer;
}
.ifacm__back:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color: #fff; }
.ifacm__hint {
  font-size: 0.78rem; color: rgba(200,210,230,0.4);
  text-align: center; margin: 0;
}

/* ── Ifa Import Tab ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
.iimport-tab { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 32px 80px; }

.iimport-hd { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 36px; }
.iimport-title {
  font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 2.4rem);
  font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.5px; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.2;
}
.iimport-lead {
  font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--muted);
  max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;
}
.iimport-lead strong { color: var(--text); }

/* Energy concept bar */
.iimport-concept {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px;
  max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto 44px;
  padding: 18px 22px; border-radius: 12px;
  background: rgba(240, 200, 64, 0.05);
  border: 1px solid rgba(240, 200, 64, 0.22);
}
.iimport-concept__ogbe {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  width: 54px; height: 54px;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: rgba(240, 200, 64, 0.12);
  border: 1.5px solid rgba(240, 200, 64, 0.45);
  color: #f0c840; font-weight: 900; font-size: 0.7rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: center;
}
.iimport-concept__text { font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--muted); margin: 0; }
.iimport-concept__text strong { color: var(--text); }

/* Section heading */
.iimport-section-hd { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px; }
.iimport-section-title { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.3px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.iimport-section-sub {
  font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;
  line-height: 1.65;
}
.iimport-section-sub strong { color: var(--text); }

/* Examples list */
.iimport-examples { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto 48px; }

/* Bridge card */
.iimport-card {
  padding: 16px 22px; border-radius: 12px;
  background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  transition: border-color 0.2s;
}
.iimport-card:hover { border-color: rgba(240,200,64,0.28); }

/* Main row */
.iimport-row {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.iimport-fname { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; flex-shrink: 0; }
.iimport-fname--sm { font-size: 0.88rem; }
.iimport-paren { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted); white-space: nowrap; }
.iimport-paren--sm { font-size: 0.8rem; }
.iimport-result-name { color: var(--text); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; }

/* Dual row */
.iimport-dual-row {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;
  padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
}
.iimport-dual-tag {
  font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #f0c840; background: rgba(240,200,64,0.1);
  border: 1px solid rgba(240,200,64,0.28);
  padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; flex-shrink: 0;
}

/* Energy line */
.iimport-eline {
  display: flex; align-items: center;
  flex: 1; min-width: 80px; max-width: 220px; margin: 0 2px;
}
.iimport-eline__arr { color: #f0c840; font-size: 0.6rem; flex-shrink: 0; opacity: 0.85; }
.iimport-eline__track {
  flex: 1; position: relative; height: 0;
  border-top: 1.5px dashed rgba(240,200,64,0.4);
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
}
.iimport-eline__lbl {
  position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%;
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  background: var(--bg2);
  padding: 0 7px; line-height: 1.6;
  color: #f0c840; font-size: 0.67rem;
  font-style: italic; font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em; white-space: nowrap;
}

/* Interactive builder */
.iimport-builder {
  max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 24px; border-radius: 14px;
  background: var(--bg3); border: 1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.2);
}
.iimport-builder__hd { margin-bottom: 20px; }
.iimport-builder__title { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 4px; }
.iimport-builder__sub { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--muted); }
.iimport-selectors {
  display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 12px;
  flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.iimport-sel-wrap { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; flex: 1; min-width: 150px; }
.iimport-sel-label {
  font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted);
}
.iimport-sel {
  padding: 9px 12px; border-radius: 8px;
  background: var(--bg4); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  color: var(--text); font-size: 0.9rem; cursor: pointer;
  transition: border-color 0.2s;
}
.iimport-sel:hover, .iimport-sel:focus { border-color: rgba(139,92,246,0.5); outline: none; }
.iimport-sel-sep {
  flex-shrink: 0; padding-bottom: 10px;
  font-size: 0.75rem; font-style: italic; font-weight: 700;
  color: #f0c840; letter-spacing: 0.04em; white-space: nowrap;
}
.iimport-builder__same {
  text-align: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.88rem;
  padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
}
.iimport-builder .iimport-eline__lbl { background: var(--bg2); }

/* ── EoFX Section ── */
.iimport-tag {
  display: inline-block; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #f0c840; background: rgba(240,200,64,0.12);
  border: 1px solid rgba(240,200,64,0.3);
  border-radius: 5px; padding: 2px 7px; margin-left: 8px;
  vertical-align: middle;
}
.iimport-eofx {
  max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 28px 24px; border-radius: 14px;
  background: var(--bg3); border: 1px solid rgba(240,200,64,0.2);
}
.iimport-eofx__formula {
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  gap: 14px; margin: 22px auto 28px;
  padding: 16px 24px; border-radius: 10px;
  background: rgba(240,200,64,0.07); border: 1px solid rgba(240,200,64,0.25);
  max-width: 480px; flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.iimport-eofx__lhs {
  font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; color: #f0c840;
}
.iimport-eofx__lhs em { font-style: italic; }
.iimport-eofx__eq { font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--muted); }
.iimport-eofx__rhs { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); }
.iimport-eofx__rhs em { font-style: italic; color: #f0c840; }
.iimport-eofx__examples {
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 28px;
}
.iimport-eofx__card {
  padding: 14px 18px; border-radius: 10px;
  background: var(--bg4); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
}
.iimport-eofx__card-top {
  display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px;
  flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 5px;
}
.iimport-eofx__ifa { font-size: 0.98rem; font-weight: 800; }
.iimport-eofx__eq2 { font-size: 0.98rem; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 300; }
.iimport-eofx__energy { font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text); }
.iimport-eofx__energy em { font-style: italic; }
.iimport-eofx__desc { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 0; line-height: 1.55; }
.iimport-eofx__builder {
  padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
}
.iimport-eofx__builder-lbl {
  display: block; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.iimport-eofx__builder-lbl strong { color: #f0c840; }
.iimport-eofx__builder-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.iimport-eofx__input {
  flex: 1; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px;
  background: var(--bg4); border: 1.5px solid rgba(240,200,64,0.25);
  color: var(--text); font-size: 0.95rem; transition: border-color 0.2s;
}
.iimport-eofx__input::placeholder { color: var(--muted); }
.iimport-eofx__input:focus { border-color: rgba(240,200,64,0.6); outline: none; }
.iimport-eofx__result {
  padding: 16px 18px; border-radius: 10px;
  background: rgba(240,200,64,0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(240,200,64,0.3);
}
.iimport-eofx__result-line {
  display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px;
  flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.iimport-eofx__result-ifa { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800; color: #f0c840; }
.iimport-eofx__result-eq  { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--muted); }
.iimport-eofx__result-energy { font-size: 0.96rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); }
.iimport-eofx__result-energy em { color: #f0c840; font-style: italic; }
.iimport-eofx__result-desc {
  font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 0; line-height: 1.6;
}

@media (max-width: 500px) {
  .ifaview-tab__title { letter-spacing: -.5px; }
  .system-toggle { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
  .sys-btn       { min-width: 0; }
  .steamsex-legend, .sidechrx-legend { gap: 4px; }
  .ptoe-axes     { flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .modal__ft     { flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; }
  .node-diagram svg { width: 200px; height: 200px; }
  .iimport-tab  { padding: 28px 14px 56px; }
  .iimport-card { padding: 12px 14px; }
  .iimport-row, .iimport-dual-row { gap: 5px; }
  .iimport-fname { font-size: 0.88rem; }
  .iimport-eline { max-width: 110px; }
  .iimport-builder { padding: 14px; }
  .iimport-selectors { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
  .iimport-sel-sep { padding-bottom: 0; text-align: center; }
  .iimport-concept { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
}
